[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6542.07, "timestamp": "01:49:02", "text": "ええ、金物屋です。私は富士山が大好きです。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6544.149, "timestamp": "01:49:04", "text": "盗めたらいいのに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6546.229, "timestamp": "01:49:06", "text": "もの。富士山です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6550.629, "timestamp": "01:49:10", "text": "何てことだ。富士。富士。えっと、お父さん。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6551.55, "timestamp": "01:49:11", "text": "私の"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6556.008, "timestamp": "01:49:16", "author": "@everestfujich", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/cGf4x80kyXWdAQCEpiCAT1VX7LnsLDD0GjZXaK-xsp1-Ky9Av7IrQcFxwWsVy873fVtPRn54UQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "halo, hope yall havin fun^^!"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6556.87, "timestamp": "01:49:16", "text": "ない。彼は偽物だ。薬物を使用する"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6558.55, "timestamp": "01:49:18", "text": "対処する。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6561.91, "timestamp": "01:49:21", "text": "傲慢になるべきではない。偽物だ。あなた"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6564.31, "timestamp": "01:49:24", "text": "偽の父親。うん。やあ、ルーシー。どうやって"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6567.005, "timestamp": "01:49:27", "author": "@everestfujich", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/cGf4x80kyXWdAQCEpiCAT1VX7LnsLDD0GjZXaK-xsp1-Ky9Av7IrQcFxwWsVy873fVtPRn54UQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ye im real dad i go get milk "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6567.669, "timestamp": "01:49:27", "text": "何をしているの？わかった。ああ、くたばれ、ルーシー。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6570.39, "timestamp": "01:49:30", "text": "あの、ワットさん、イチゴを売ってもいいですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6573.79, "timestamp": "01:49:33", "text": "味付きの薬をお願いします。一体何を考えているんだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6577.03, "timestamp": "01:49:37", "text": "フレーバードラッグが欲しいですか？ええ、私は本物です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6579.669, "timestamp": "01:49:39", "text": "男。私は牛乳を買いに行く。ありますか ありますか ありますか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6581.83, "timestamp": "01:49:41", "text": "落下による損傷？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6583.189, "timestamp": "0